#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:78 e9de9d6473d04e09aaac0f3a656e36ba
msgid "Default UART order"
msgstr "默认 UART 顺序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:80 03529f0e4c254dffa67bfc4fe8927271
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚图中，UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚是 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚是 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:83 265c5d34b36c4ffabaaf355a027423e7
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:84 bf4d094d24d84e73abdbace6d8dc4bf7
msgid "SERIAL1 -> UART1 (DMA-enabled, MSP DisplayPort OSD on DJI Connector)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> UART1（支持 DMA，DJI 接口上的 MSP DisplayPort OSD）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:85 909e84cd2a204878adcdb6ca9433daab
msgid "SERIAL2 -> UART2 (DMA-enabled, GPS)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> UART2（支持 DMA，GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:86 705ec871c63944a18f9d37af298bc6e9
msgid "SERIAL3 -> UART3 (DMA-enabled, RCin)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> UART3（支持 DMA，RC 输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:87 64316e5092a24efcbd28bb1955fd61b5
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (RX on ESC connector for ESC Telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（ESC 接口上的 RX，用于 ESC 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:88 ba293e688c884f2dae24c9d96a080731
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART5 (spare)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（备用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:89 cb8f63f8c0e94fd389e013abd6349f58
msgid ""
"SERIAL6 -> UART6 (spare, PWM 9 and 10 by default, use "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 for UART)"
msgstr ""
"SERIAL6 -> UART6（备用，默认为 PWM 9 和 10，使用 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` "
"= 1 可切换为 UART）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:90 d13b4e97c41740569b88b2b5e8974714
msgid "SERIAL7 -> UART7 (RX pin only on DJI Connector)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（仅 DJI 接口上的 RX 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:93 23695032696f4f38843f192a6a5a146c
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:95 7eb7e6f4810441108bf7853d36c353f2
msgid ""
"The RC receiver 5 V pad next to RX3 (\"+\") is also powered from USB for "
"easy and safe configuration without having to connect the main battery."
msgstr "RX3 旁边的 RC 接收机 5V 焊盘（「+」）也从 USB 供电，便于在不连接主电池的情况下安全配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:97 5551598531e542738ef9580435e9a7e6
msgid ""
"The RX3 pin, can be used for all ArduPilot supported single wire receiver "
"protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. "
"However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RX3 引脚可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的单线接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这些协议需要真正的 UART "
"连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:99 40123370050e433587dd8c426ca39763
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, use the TX3 pin also."
msgstr "要支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，还需同时使用 TX3 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:101 1bb93fb839b5483db3f2677ed0cc9546
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:103 bc3dded6d466498ca67ed56c60d8a577
msgid "SBUS needs no special configuration."
msgstr "SBUS 无需特殊配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:105 e870b112988a417da7c52b1d6aa281fc
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX3 and :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 TX3，并将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:107 4828f162c0004e3cb5828b11e01a9e45
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX3 connection, in addition to RX3, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 RX3 外还需要 TX3 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:109 5ca25e621ef64294aa383495dbb2d352
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to Tx6 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 Tx6，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:111 9d91a3009dbd4edd96dc0c3f87432217
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详情请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:113 878859311f7f49cdaadda155e5d66515
msgid ""
"RX6 can be configured for RCin coming from DJI air units by setting "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` to something other than \"23\" and"
" setting :ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 设置为「23」以外的值，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` 设置为「23」，可将 RX6 配置为接收来自 DJI 图传的 RC "
"输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:117 6d8e415786b9485e93696c4ddccb156c
msgid "Motor/Servo Outputs"
msgstr "电机/舵机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:119 898ceaea67ae4cbb990cdf57ce786d7e
msgid ""
"The RADIX 2 HD has a total of 10 PWM outputs. All support PWM and DShot. The"
" first 8 outputs salso upport BDSHOT and are on the two 4-in-1 ESC "
"connectors. The PWM outputs are in groups of 2 channels each, all channels "
"in the same group need to use the same configuration / rate."
msgstr ""
"RADIX 2 HD 共有 10 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持 PWM 和 DShot。前 8 路输出还支持 BDSHOT，位于两个 4 合 1 "
"ESC 接口上。PWM 输出每 2 个通道为一组，同组内所有通道需使用相同的配置/频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:123 8b8949737b2e4f08a66ecfbd1b117bde
msgid "PWM 1-2 Group 1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:124 b2ac48f7d2f34f79ac906a1dec3de469
msgid "PWM 3-4 Group 2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4 第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:125 c48a47b5c50545a7880247db2df58d67
msgid "PWM 5-6 Group 3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:126 1d55a22e49ef45059736ac2b0a80771d
msgid "PWM 7-8 Group 4"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:127 583fc91921e843ad869109616d1fc559
msgid ""
"PWM 9-10 Group 5 (These are output on the TX6 and RX6 pads by default and "
"can also be reconfigured for use as SERIAL6 instead using "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 )"
msgstr ""
"PWM 9-10 第 5 组（默认输出在 TX6 和 RX6 焊盘上，也可使用 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 重新配置为 SERIAL6）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:130 28c99cf40ec64dd3a37d1e9e4432cf69
msgid "Analog inputs"
msgstr "模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:132 a59982c771e444f59684be83c80693b8
msgid "The RADIX 2 HD has 3 analog inputs:"
msgstr "RADIX 2 HD 有 3 路模拟输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:134 9de94ec9c40741998137efa6c0c662c5
msgid ""
"ADC Pin 10 -> Battery Voltage (VBAT pin, builtin 1:17.6 voltage divider)"
msgstr "ADC 引脚 10 -> 电池电压（VBAT 引脚，内置 1:17.6 分压器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:135 90904c86423949a2968bd5f1018aa968
msgid "ADC Pin 3  -> Battery Current Sensor, 3.3V max (CUR pin)"
msgstr "ADC 引脚 3  -> 电池电流传感器，最高 3.3V（CUR 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:136 f9c6ca8a12cd4eec86aadefdd66e7f1c
msgid "ADC Pin 11 -> RSSI voltage monitoring, 3.3V max (RSSI pad)"
msgstr "ADC 引脚 11 -> RSSI 电压监控，最高 3.3V（RSSI 焊盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:139 82c74cab18a64924a1f8b5a76280b6b8
msgid "Video Transmitter Power Control"
msgstr "视频发射器电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:141 76b4cdaebcec420a9deb685af9e20699
msgid ""
"The 9V output supply can be turned off by using the RELAY function in "
"ArduPilot. By default it is turned on, but turn it off:"
msgstr "9V 输出供电可通过 ArduPilot 的 RELAY 功能关闭。默认为开启，关闭方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:143 c14704d3494c4adcb0f978f8152b3e0d
msgid ""
"or example, use RC Channel 10 to control the supply switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用 RC 通道 10 通过继电器 2 控制供电开关："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:145 4b73b775d01a4a3591a0b1aff94ecb01
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>`  = \"81\""
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>`  = 「81」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:146 da718897ec254bb196083ae8473aadd2
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:148 556edd9801bd4e8185ebde0c9922b09e
msgid "A low on the switch will turn off the supply to the 9V pad."
msgstr "开关低电平将关闭 9V 焊盘的供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:151 6bb01e2320b9406d909f697342be8374
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:153 26067e9ef6874869bd801415d4801902
msgid ""
"The RADIX 2 HD can monitor battery voltages up to 12S using a built-in "
"voltage divider. The board itself can be powered by battery voltages up to "
"8S (35 V) and there is a jumper to use the same pin for battery voltage "
"monitoring and for powering the board."
msgstr ""
"RADIX 2 HD 可通过内置分压器监控最高 12S 的电池电压。飞控板本身可由最高 "
"8S（35V）的电池供电，并有一个跳线可将同一引脚用于电池电压监控和为飞控板供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:157 893e0e4bb06d4c03a0940bc2c2e15d10
msgid ""
"Powering the board with more than 8S (35 V) with the \"PWR:VBAT\" jumper "
"soldered will permanently damage it. Refer to the above linked User Manual "
"for more details."
msgstr "在焊接了「PWR:VBAT」跳线的情况下，用超过 8S（35V）的电压为飞控板供电将造成永久性损坏。详情请参阅上述用户手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:159 84f5405dd0a14eb58d95ad8c880340c5
msgid ""
"In addition to voltage sensing, the board also has an input for an external "
"current sensor."
msgstr "除电压感测外，飞控板还有一个外部电流传感器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:161 2197623e3d964c4694e927200e979640
msgid ""
"Parameters for use with a typical 4in1 ESC are already set by default. The "
"value of the :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"may need to be changed to match your ESC:"
msgstr ""
"与典型 4 合 1 ESC "
"配合使用的参数已默认设置。:ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"的值可能需要根据您的 ESC 进行调整："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:163 6c9395341f604cb59aaf8f2b4eab85be
msgid "The default parameter settings are:"
msgstr "默认参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:165 3d0f5c8e9d87412f9a73bf46509614bb
msgid "Enable Battery monitor with these parameter settings :"
msgstr "使用以下参数设置启用电池监控器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:167 bcac5c2f02a745b4a5adbdc27971ac91
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:169 b55e652a91c840949a34549d5e35a8aa
msgid "Then reboot."
msgstr "然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:171 c9d46137f68445af972797609a123499
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
