#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:180 a71db3da32974d92a2876219cefc5d1f
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:182 2dda7f1806fc4a5eb15cbbc4e02c9f59
msgid ""
"The RADIX 2 HD uses a proprietary bootloader which needs a firmware file in "
"a custom file format. There are several ways of obtaining the firmware file,"
" as explained below. Once you have obtained the file, copy it to the USB "
"drive that appears when connecting the RADIX 2 HD to your computer when it "
"is in bootloader mode (hold the BOOT button and release when connecting to "
"USB). Once it finishes copying, safely remove the drive. At this point the "
"RADIX 2 HD will reboot and run the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"RADIX 2 HD 使用专有引导程序，需要特定文件格式的固件文件。获取固件文件有多种方法，详见下文。获取文件后，在将 RADIX 2 HD "
"以引导程序模式（按住 BOOT 按钮并在连接 USB 时松开）连接到计算机时出现的 USB 驱动器中复制该文件。复制完成后，安全弹出驱动器。此时 "
"RADIX 2 HD 将重启并运行 ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:184 b305d7fc1b8344f9a1f3822843c01f9e
msgid ""
"When using ArduPilot, it is necessary to have a microSD card inserted, "
"without it the firmware won't run."
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 时，必须插入 MicroSD 卡，否则固件无法运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:187 e2d9aa9d614f4a438d6d02aafc6ab031
msgid "Option 1: Download the Firmware File the BrainFPV Website"
msgstr "方法 1：从 BrainFPV 网站下载固件文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:189 8f22cbaa76454382af971e5b8bf77454
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get firmware files for your RADIX 2 HD is to download "
"them from the BrainFPV website. You can do so `here "
"<https://www.brainfpv.com/firmware/>`__."
msgstr ""
"获取 RADIX 2 HD 固件文件的最简便方法是从 BrainFPV 网站下载。可在 `此处 "
"<https://www.brainfpv.com/firmware/>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:192 4c63091c41084850821f6cca164a1fc4
msgid "Option 2: Download the Firmware From the ArduPilot Firmware Server"
msgstr "方法 2：从 ArduPilot 固件服务器下载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:194 6ff667054af04407872b571b3d49540c
msgid ""
"Download the ELF file from the `ArduPilot Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__. Make sure you download the file for the"
" \"RADIX2HD\" target. For example, the ELF file for ArduCopter is called "
"\"arducopter.elf\". At this time, only the 4.5 (\"latest\") versions are "
"available."
msgstr ""
"从 `ArduPilot 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 下载 ELF "
"文件。请确保下载「RADIX2HD」目标的文件。例如，ArduCopter 的 ELF 文件名为「arducopter.elf」。目前仅提供 "
"4.5（「latest」）版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:196 fcfa2f8233d7465b8ee3f384712269ac
msgid ""
"In order to use the ELF file with your RADIX 2 HD, it needs to be converted "
"using the BrainFPV Firmware Packer. This utility is implemented in Python, "
"so you will need a Python installation."
msgstr ""
"要将 ELF 文件用于 RADIX 2 HD，需要使用 BrainFPV 固件打包工具进行转换。此工具基于 Python 实现，因此需要安装 "
"Python。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:198 05e4e278c7804a8db301cd0d8248b2fb
msgid ""
"If you are using Linux, use your package manager to install Python 3. If you"
" are using Windows, download the Python 3 installer from the Python Website "
"and run it. When installing, make sure to select \"Add Python to PATH\", so "
"you will be able to use Python from the Windows Command Prompt."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用 Linux，请通过包管理器安装 Python 3。如果使用 Windows，请从 Python 官网下载 Python 3 "
"安装程序并运行。安装时，务必选择「Add Python to PATH」，以便在 Windows 命令提示符中使用 Python。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:200 a084ae7f05834e7d84e1c2afe6548d25
msgid ""
"After installing Python, start the Command Prompt and install the BrainFPV "
"Firmware Packer using the following command:"
msgstr "安装 Python 后，启动命令提示符，使用以下命令安装 BrainFPV 固件打包工具："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:207 3f74be13b9ca48749aabab47d544849a
msgid ""
"After installing it, you can use the following command to convert the "
"\"arducopter.elf\" (or other vehicle elf file) file to a \"arducopter.bin\" "
"file that can be used with the RADIX 2 HD:"
msgstr ""
"安装后，可使用以下命令将「arducopter.elf」（或其他飞行器 elf 文件）转换为可用于 RADIX 2 HD "
"的「arducopter.bin」文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:215 1c031cab5bb04daf8199ba360775eb6a
msgid "Option 3: Compile the Firmware Yourself"
msgstr "方法 3：自行编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:217 db27a635e1fd4d11a8ede8babd8bc276
msgid ""
"If you have a working :ref:`ArduPilot build environment<building-the-code>`,"
" you can compile the firmware yourself and then convert it to the format "
"needed by the BrainFPV bootloader. You will also need the BrainFPV Firmware "
"Packer to do so. Install it using the \"pip install\" command shown above."
msgstr ""
"如果您有可用的 :ref:`ArduPilot 构建环境<building-the-code>`，可以自行编译固件，然后将其转换为 BrainFPV "
"引导程序所需的格式。您还需要 BrainFPV 固件打包工具。使用上述「pip install」命令安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:219 2867893c0fba4fbead1c162a89d1db3c
msgid "For Copter, build the firmware as follows:"
msgstr "对于 Copter，按如下方式构建固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:226 ecaca6e5674749d0bb6377c9ee53919b
msgid ""
"other vehicles can be built, but the RADIX2HD is targeted primarily for "
"copter applications. Then use the firmware packer script to create the "
"firmware file that can be used with the BrainFPV bootloader:"
msgstr "也可以构建其他飞行器固件，但 RADIX2HD 主要针对多旋翼应用。然后使用固件打包脚本创建可用于 BrainFPV 引导程序的固件文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:232 80048ac3d0f7465fbffc0d5f518891df
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To use it, copy the resulting arducopter_{VERSION}_brainfpv.bin to the USB "
"drive that appears when the RADIX 2 HD is in bootloader mode."
